# Tumor-responsive copper-activated disulfiram for synergetic nanocatalytic tumor therapy

Hao Chen\(^{1,\S}\), Xi Li\(^{1,\S}\), Minfeng Huo\(^{3}\) \((\boxtimes)\), Liying Wang\(^{4}\), Yu Chen\(^{2,3}\) \((\boxtimes)\), Wei Chen\(^{1}\), and Bailang Wang\(^{1}\) \((\boxtimes)\)

